('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104', 1, 'post_test', 'In SINGLE DISPLACEMENT, what happens?', 'Ions of two compounds swap', 'One element replaces another element in a compound', 'One compound splits into two', 'Oxygen reacts with a hydrocarbon', 'B', 'General form: AB + C → AC + B.', true),
