('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104', 1, 'post_test', 'Neutralization is a special type of:', 'Decomposition', 'Combination', 'Combustion', 'Double displacement', 'D', 'H⁺ from the acid and the metal from the base exchange places.', true),
('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104', 1, 'post_test', 'Which change is reversible and only alters form?', 'Digesting food', 'Tarnishing silver', 'Melting wax', 'Burning wood', 'C', 'Melting is a physical change.', true),
